### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anas@test.com",
  "password": "password123456"
}

### Login wrong password
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anas@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

